    <row halign="center">
       
        <cell>Farmer Ali had a well on his property 200 feet deep.  When the well went dry, he hired a company to drill the well deeper.  He used the equation <m>d(t)=-75t-200</m> to find the depth of the well, <m>d</m>, using the number of days the company drilled, <m>t</m>. <m>\vphantom{\Huge{M}}</m> </cell>
